    "title": "AC Remote - Air Conditioner",
    "description": "Install Our Universal\u00a0AC\u00a0Remote\u00a0Control APP Now, You Can Remote AC Anywhere. Please Do Not Hesitate To Throw Away Your Physical AC Remote Control. Air Conditioner Remote Control APP to Make Everything Controllable. \r\n\r\n<b>Download the All\u00a0AC\u00a0Remote\u00a0Control APP, Not Only Can Adjust Temperature Quickly, But Also Can Use Other Functions Easily: Switch Mode, Timer, Turn On/Off and so on. What's More, Our aircon remote control is in a Users-friendly Interface Design, Which Make Your Air Conditioners To Be Controlled Easily By Your All Family Members, Especially for the Elderly.</b>\r\n\r\n<b>Features:</b>\r\n\ud83d\udd25IR Blaster AC Remote, ir blaster for ac\r\n\ud83d\udd25Remote Control for AC Anywhere, smart AC remote app\r\n\ud83d\udd25Massive Brands Supported:\r\n-Voltas AC Remote, Samsung AC Remote Control, LG AC Remote, Daikin AC Remote Control, Haier AC Remote Control , Dawlance AC Remote, Hitachi AC Remote Control, Remote AC  Panasonic, WhirlPool AC Remote Control, Toshiba AC Remote Control, Mi Remote for AC, Orient AC Remote,IFB AC Remote,Remote AC Sharp, Kelvinator AC Remote,etc\r\n\r\nHow to use:\r\nStep1-Add Your AC Remote Brands or Models\r\nStep2-Tap the Test Buttons to Check the Universal AC\u00a0Remote\u00a0Control\r\nStep3-Setting Your All\u00a0AC\u00a0Remote\u00a0Control\r\nStep4-Use Your Universal AC Remote to remote air conditioner\r\n\r\nTIPs:\r\n-Make Sure Your Phone Supports Infrared (IR) Emitter, the APP is Suitable for IR Blaster remote for AC.\r\n-When You Need to Download a Resource Pack for Your Air Conditioner(AC), Check to See If Your Phone is Connected to the Internet.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer of Aircond remote control:\r\n-The Universal AC Remote Control APP is Not an Official AC Remote App, and is Not Affiliated with the Brands Above in Anyway.\r\n-The IR Remote Control for AC Requires IR Blaster, Make Sure Your Phone Supports Infrared (IR) Emitter.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Install Our Universal\u00a0AC\u00a0Remote\u00a0Control APP Now, You Can Remote AC Anywhere. Please Do Not Hesitate To Throw Away Your Physical AC Remote Control. Air Conditioner Remote Control APP to Make Everything Controllable. <br><br><b>Download the All\u00a0AC\u00a0Remote\u00a0Control APP, Not Only Can Adjust Temperature Quickly, But Also Can Use Other Functions Easily: Switch Mode, Timer, Turn On/Off and so on. What&#39;s More, Our aircon remote control is in a Users-friendly Interface Design, Which Make Your Air Conditioners To Be Controlled Easily By Your All Family Members, Especially for the Elderly.</b><br><br><b>Features:</b><br>\ud83d\udd25IR Blaster AC Remote, ir blaster for ac<br>\ud83d\udd25Remote Control for AC Anywhere, smart AC remote app<br>\ud83d\udd25Massive Brands Supported:<br>-Voltas AC Remote, Samsung AC Remote Control, LG AC Remote, Daikin AC Remote Control, Haier AC Remote Control , Dawlance AC Remote, Hitachi AC Remote Control, Remote AC  Panasonic, WhirlPool AC Remote Control, Toshiba AC Remote Control, Mi Remote for AC, Orient AC Remote,IFB AC Remote,Remote AC Sharp, Kelvinator AC Remote,etc<br><br>How to use:<br>Step1-Add Your AC Remote Brands or Models<br>Step2-Tap the Test Buttons to Check the Universal AC\u00a0Remote\u00a0Control<br>Step3-Setting Your All\u00a0AC\u00a0Remote\u00a0Control<br>Step4-Use Your Universal AC Remote to remote air conditioner<br><br>TIPs:<br>-Make Sure Your Phone Supports Infrared (IR) Emitter, the APP is Suitable for IR Blaster remote for AC.<br>-When You Need to Download a Resource Pack for Your Air Conditioner(AC), Check to See If Your Phone is Connected to the Internet.<br><br>Disclaimer of Aircond remote control:<br>-The Universal AC Remote Control APP is Not an Official AC Remote App, and is Not Affiliated with the Brands Above in Anyway.<br>-The IR Remote Control for AC Requires IR Blaster, Make Sure Your Phone Supports Infrared (IR) Emitter.",
